sequenceDiagram
 participant B as Browser
 participant W as Open WebUI
 participant K as Keycloak
 B->>W: Start OAuth login
 W->>K: Authorization Code with S256 PKCE
 K->>B: Authenticate synthetic user
 K-->>W: Exact callback with code and state
 W->>K: Exchange code and verifier
 K-->>W: Signed access token and refresh token
 W-->>B: Application session cookie
